{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>Her nobles.</b> They are the great ones, likened to the white of the eye, for the small ones are called חשובים." "<b>Royalty.</b> They call them the summoned ones, and the letter mem is lacking from the word מלוכה." "<b>Nothing.</b> Like אין."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:56:39.487288310Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}